      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofestill.sc.gov/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Estill traces its origins to the community of Lawtonville, which was largely destroyed during the Civil War by Union Army divisions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
