      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofestill.sc.gov/page/about.history"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The John Lawton House and Lawtonville Baptist Church are both listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
